  {
   "id": "alice_01_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "兔子也会迟到？",
   "displayName": "兔子也会迟到？",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_01_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "爱丽丝正要打个盹，草丛里传来滴答声。一只白兔掏出金表，急得两只长耳朵一抖：“要迟到了！”",
   "displayName": "爱丽丝正要打个盹，草丛里传来滴答声。一只白兔掏出金表，急得两只长耳朵一抖：“要迟到了！”",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_02_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "树根底下的门",
   "displayName": "树根底下的门",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_02_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "白兔在柳树根前一闪，金表也跟着不见了。爱丽丝弯腰往洞里看。“等一等！你的表究竟在赶什么？”",
   "displayName": "白兔在柳树根前一闪，金表也跟着不见了。爱丽丝弯腰往洞里看。“等一等！你的表究竟在赶什么？”",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "burrow",
   "type": "MODEL",
   "source": "burrow-stage.glb",
   "displayName": "树根书架与旧柜",
   "modelOriginMode": "SHARED_ORIGIN",
   "locked": true,
   "playEmbeddedAnimation": false
  },
  {
   "id": "cup",
   "type": "MODEL",
   "source": "cup.glb",
   "displayName": "茶杯",
   "modelOriginMode": "SHARED_ORIGIN",
   "locked": true,
   "playEmbeddedAnimation": false
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_03_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "掉了好一会儿",
   "displayName": "掉了好一会儿",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_03_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "洞里居然有书架。爱丽丝慢慢往下落，经过一本红皮书时，还来得及读完它的书名。",
   "displayName": "洞里居然有书架。爱丽丝慢慢往下落，经过一本红皮书时，还来得及读完它的书名。",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_04_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "请把杯子放好",
   "displayName": "请把杯子放好",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_04_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "一只茶杯从架边滑下来。爱丽丝轻轻一托，把它送回矮架。她的鞋底这才碰到地板。远处又响起了滴答声。",
   "displayName": "一只茶杯从架边滑下来。爱丽丝轻轻一托，把它送回矮架。她的鞋底这才碰到地板。远处又响起了滴答声。",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
