   "locked": true,
   "playEmbeddedAnimation": false
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_05_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "钥匙太小，门也太小",
   "displayName": "钥匙太小，门也太小",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_05_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "圆桌上躺着一把金钥匙。爱丽丝试遍了大门，最后才发现，墙脚还有一扇只到膝盖的小门。",
   "displayName": "圆桌上躺着一把金钥匙。爱丽丝试遍了大门，最后才发现，墙脚还有一扇只到膝盖的小门。",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_06_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "这回，谁太小？",
   "displayName": "这回，谁太小？",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_06_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "一口药水下去，小门刚好合身，钥匙却留在高高的桌上。白兔从桌边擦过，把钥匙碰了下来。叮！",
   "displayName": "一口药水下去，小门刚好合身，钥匙却留在高高的桌上。白兔从桌边擦过，把钥匙碰了下来。叮！",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "tea",
   "type": "MODEL",
   "source": "tea-stage.glb",
   "displayName": "茶桌与瓷壶",
   "modelOriginMode": "SHARED_ORIGIN",
   "locked": true,
   "playEmbeddedAnimation": false
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_07_title",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "明明还有椅子",
   "displayName": "明明还有椅子",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
  {
   "id": "alice_07_copy",
   "type": "TEXT",
   "source": "桌上摆了四只茶杯，客人却只有半顶帽子。“没位子啦！”茶壶后面传来声音。爱丽丝拉近自己的杯子：“那我站一会儿。”",
   "displayName": "桌上摆了四只茶杯，客人却只有半顶帽子。“没位子啦！”茶壶后面传来声音。爱丽丝拉近自己的杯子：“那我站一会儿。”",
   "locked": true,
   "faceViewer": true,
   "textBackgroundEnabled": true,
   "textColor": 4294963928
  },
